msgstr "Ìgbóhùnsáfẹ́fẹ́ àwòrán GNOME"

#: src/wayland_vnc/settings_app.py
msgid "General"
msgstr "Gbogbogbò"

#: src/wayland_vnc/settings_app.py
msgid "In RealVNC Viewer, add a connection to one of these. They work while local network access is on, for any device on the same network. Do not forward the port from the Internet."
msgstr "Nínú RealVNC Viewer, fi ìsopọ̀ kún ọ̀kan nínú àwọn àdírẹ́sì wọ̀nyí. Wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ nígbà tí ìwọlé láti nẹ́tíwọ̀ọ̀kì àdúgbò bá wà ní títàn, fún ẹ̀rọ èyíkéyìí lórí nẹ́tíwọ̀ọ̀kì kan náà. Má ṣe fi ìbùdó náà ránṣẹ́ láti Íńtánẹ́ẹ̀tì."

#: src/wayland_vnc/settings.py
msgid "Install the wayland-vnc package to get the systemd user unit"
msgstr "Fi package wayland-vnc sọ́nà láti gba ẹ̀ka olùlò systemd"

#: src/wayland_vnc/probe.py
msgid "KWin and capture/input portal interfaces detected."
msgstr "A rí KWin àti àwọn àtọ̀kùn ẹnu-ọ̀nà ìkópa/ìfiwọlé."

#: src/wayland_vnc/probe.py
msgid "KWin requires both ScreenCast and RemoteDesktop portal interfaces."
msgstr "KWin nílò àwọn ààrín ẹnu-ọ̀nà méjèèjì: ScreenCast àti RemoteDesktop."

